      "summary": "Quaker: the backstory, in Iowa City. Young Maya is raised by Sarah, a single mother and the minister of a programmed Friends church, who is well-meaning but absent, and neglectful to the point of harm. The game eases the player into dissociation and the first time losing time. An older Friend in the church tries to be there for Maya and fails. It ends with the very first switch, home alone in Maya's room after services, then a blackout."
